  "user_request_original": "Optimize a 14-layer HfO2/SiO2 alternating stack on Fused Silica substrate with Air incident medium. Initialize thicknesses at nominal quarter-wave values (λ₀=550 nm center of visible stopband): HfO2 layers at 550/(4×n_HfO2), SiO2 layers at 550/(4×n_SiO2). Apply ±10% bounds on each thickness during optimization. Layer sequence: HfO2 | SiO2 | HfO2 | SiO2 | HfO2 | SiO2 | HfO2 | SiO2 | HfO2 | SiO2 | HfO2 | SiO2 | HfO2 | SiO2 (14 finite layers). Optimize for maximum transmittance in 1530-1565 nm band and maximum reflectance in 400-700 nm band. Use gradient-based thickness optimizer. Canonical user controls: wavelength intervals 1530-1565 nm, 400-700 nm. soft objectives: High transmittance in 1530-1565 nm band; High reflectance in 400-700 nm band. behaviors to suppress or avoid: Low reflectance in 1530-1565 nm band; Low transmittance in 400-700 nm band. manufacturing constraints: Maximum 30 layers.",
